                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game had an interesting start. I started by checking out the pvp. It took me to a level where there was nobody and nothing in but a deadly floor. Great start, I'm hooked. I then started playing through the levels with full intention to complete the game but was soft locked at level 9. I beat every level no deaths and continued to be locked. I tried then to play the game on another pc. The game made me restart through the tutorial and complete all 9 levels again to be still softlocked at 9. Funny enough though, the game still tracked all my stars from previous play throughs and I ended up on the leaderboard stuck at 9. There looks like an ability to purchase micro transactions and at one point it attempted to make to wait 3 min. to just play a level because I guess a unlock code for a level wrong. wow just wow my guy this ain't it. 1/10 #duckviews",
